+ ### What You Actually Install
+ **The REAL security plugin is a separate npm package:**
+ | Component | Location | What It Is |
+ |-----------|----------|------------|
+ | **This ClawHub skill** | `clawhub.ai/ThomasLWang/moltguard` | Documentation only (what you're reading now) |
+ | **Actual plugin** | `npm: @openguardrails/moltguard` | Real code that intercepts tool calls, makes network calls, stores credentials |
