+ **Only install in production after completing all verification steps.**
+ ### What Gets Installed
+ **When you run `openclaw plugins install @openguardrails/moltguard`, OpenClaw will:**
+ 1. **Download npm package** from npmjs.com
+ 2. **Extract to** `~/.openclaw/extensions/moltguard/`
+ 3. **Load plugin** on OpenClaw restart
+ 4. **Plugin will:**
+    - Intercept agent tool calls (file access, bash commands, etc.)
+    - Create credentials in `~/.openclaw/credentials/moltguard/`
+    - Make network calls to `openguardrails.com/core` (detection API)
+    - Optionally run local gateway on `localhost:38790` (if enabled)
+ **This skill (documentation) does NOT do any of the above.**
+ ### Alternative: Don't Install, Just Learn
