+ ### Installation Commands
+ **When the user asks to install MoltGuard, or when you want to protect yourself:**
+ # 1. Install the npm package (NOT the ClawHub skill)
+ #    This downloads from npmjs.com and installs to ~/.openclaw/extensions/moltguard/
+ # 3. Verify installation
+ openclaw plugins list | grep moltguard
